  "ai_usage": "Responsive type without breakpoints. Always include a rem term in the middle value (1rem + 2.5vw) so the size still responds to the user's font-size setting — a pure vw value breaks zoom.",
  "path": "effects/typography-systems/type-fluid-clamp-scale.html",
  "source": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Fluid Type with clamp()</title>\n  <script type=\"application/json\" id=\"effect-meta\">\n  {\n    \"id\": \"type-fluid-clamp-scale\",\n    \"title\": \"Fluid Type with clamp()\",\n    \"summary\": \"Sizes that interpolate between viewport bounds.\",\n    \"description\": \"Sizes that interpolate between viewport bounds.\",\n    \"theme\": \"typography-systems\",\n    \"categories\": [\"typography\", \"reference\"],\n    \"tags\": [\"typography\", \"type\", \"fluid\", \"clamp\", \"viewport\", \"responsive\"],\n    \"tech\": [\"css\"],\n    \"era\": \"2020s\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"intermediate\",\n    \"dependencies\": [],\n    \"browser_support\": \"All modern browsers (Chromium, Firefox, Safari).\",\n    \"performance_notes\": \"Lightweight — composited transform/opacity work only.\",\n    \"accessibility_notes\": \"Type systems must survive user font-size settings: size in rem, never lock line-height in px, and keep the measure under 75 characters.\",\n    \"customization\": [\n      { \"name\": \"--min\", \"description\": \"Minimum size\", \"default\": \"1.5rem\" },\n      { \"name\": \"--max\", \"description\": \"Maximum size\", \"default\": \"2.6rem\" }\n    ],\n    \"variations\": [\"Swap in your own scale\", \"Export as design tokens\"],\n    \"ai_usage\": \"Responsive type without breakpoints. Always include a rem term in the middle value (1rem + 2.5vw) so the size still responds to the user's font-size setting — a pure vw value breaks zoom.\"\n  }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }\n    body { display: grid; place-items: center; background: #0b0d12; color: #e7ebf3;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif; overflow: hidden; }\n    .fx { width: 300px; display: grid; gap: .8rem; }\n    .fx h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1rem + 2.5vw, 2.6rem); line-height: 1.15; }\n    .fx p { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(.9rem, .85rem + .3vw, 1.05rem); line-height: 1.6; color: #8b93a7; }\n    .fx code { display: block; margin-top: .4rem; padding: .5rem .7rem; border-radius: 8px; background: #10141f;\n      color: #b9a5ff; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: .72rem; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"fx\"><h2>Fluid headings resize with the viewport</h2>\n  <p>Resize the frame: the heading interpolates smoothly instead of jumping at breakpoints.</p>\n  <code>clamp(1.5rem, 1rem + 2.5vw, 2.6rem)</code></div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
